{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"35":"Combing the Hair (Kitab Al-Tarajjul)"},"section_detail":{"35":{"hadithnumber_first":4159,"hadithnumber_last":4213,"arabicnumber_first":4159,"arabicnumber_last":4213,"name_native":"كتاب الترجّل"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4168,"arabicnumber":4168,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن حنبل، ومسدد، قالا حدثنا يحيى، عن عبيد الله، قال حدثني نافع، عن عبد الله، قال لعن رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم الواصلة والمستوصلة والواشمة والمستوشمة","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (5947) Sahih Muslim (2124)"}],"reference":{"book":35,"hadith":10}}]}